{
  "_comment_1_18_2": "1.18.2 port note: injectors.defaultRequire is 0, not 1. Several Connector injectors target 1.20.1-only members (e.g. item.ItemStackMixin -> 'lambda$useOn$3', which cannot exist on 1.18.2 because the whole body is inlined into ItemStack#useOn/m_41661_). InjectionInfo#validateTargets() only throws InvalidInjectionException when requiredCallbackCount > 0; with 0 a missing target becomes a silent no-op (see bytecode: 'ifle 198' -> 'return'). Keeping it at 0 lets a single boot run surface every incompatibility instead of one per run.",
